SUMMARY:Day of Action: Stop Ford’s TTC Takeover - by Progress Toronto and
  TTC Riders
LOCATION:Various locations
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.progresstoronto.ca/stop-ford-ttc-takeover-may-9-2026\n\nHoste
 d by Progress Toronto and TTC Riders ()\n\nJoin Progress Toronto and
  TTCriders for a Day of Action to talk to transit riders across Toronto to
  get them to take action to keep Ford’s hands off our public transit.
